      "blockType": "Event",
      "rawSource": "(Extracted from full RTF)",
      "cleanSource": "\u0026GridPageSize = Grid.Rows\n\t\u0026CountRoles = 0\n\t\u0026RolesXPage = 10 \n\t\u0026GAMUser.Load(\u0026UserId)\t\n\tif not \u0026FilName.IsEmpty()\n\t\t\u0026Filter.Name\t= !\u0022%\u0022 \u002B \u0026FilName\n\tendif\n\t\u0026Filter.ExternalId\t= !\u0022%\u0022 \u002B \u0026FilExternalId\n\t\n\t\u0026BtnAddRole\t\t= ActionTexts.Add\n\t\u0026GAMRoles = GAMRepository.GetRoles(\u0026Filter, \u0026Errors)\n\tIf \u0026GAMRoles.Count = 0\n\t\t\u0026GridPageCount = 0\n\tElse\n\t\t\u0026GridPageCount = (\u0026GAMRoles.Count/\u0026GridPageSize) \u002B iif(Mod(\u0026GAMRoles.Count, \u0026GridPageSize) \u003E 0, 1, 0)\n\tEndIf\n\t\u0026GridRecordCount = \u0026GAMRoles.Count\n\tFor \u0026GAMRole in \u0026GAMRoles\n\t\t\u0026Exists = false\n\t\tFor \u0026Role in \u0026GAMUser.GetRoles(\u0026Errors)\n\t\t\tDo \u0027DisplayErrors\u0027\n\t\t\tIf \u0026Role.Id = \u0026GAMRole.Id\n\t\t\t\t\u0026Exists = true\n\t\t\t\texit\n\t\t\tEndIf\n\t\tEndFor\n\t\tIf \u0026Exists = False\n\t\t\t\u0026CountRoles \u002B= 1\n\t\t\t\u0026Select\t\t= False\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\u0026Id\t  \t\t= \u0026GAMRole.Id\n\t\t\t\u0026Name \t\t= \u0026GAMRole.Name\n\t/* Generated by DVelop Work With Plus Pattern [Start] - Do not change */\n\t//this code should be inside the For Each used to load the data\n\t\n\t//Sample conditions to be added manually:\n\t//Where \u003CAttribute\u003E like \u0026FilName when not \u0026FilName.IsEmpty()\n\t//Where \u003CAttribute\u003E like \u0026GAMDescriptionLong when not \u0026GAMDescriptionLong.IsEmpty()\n\t\n\t\u0026Update = !\u0027\u003Ci class=\u0022fa fa-pen\u0022\u003E\u003C/i\u003E\u0027\n\t\n\t\u0026Delete = !\u0027\u003Ci class=\u0022fa fa-times\u0022\u003E\u003C/i\u003E\u0027\n\t/* Generated by DVelop Work With Plus Pattern [End] - Do not change */\n\t\t\tGrid.Load()\n\t\tEndIf\n\tEndFor"
