    {
      "blockName": "\u0027DoAddSelected\u0027",
      "blockType": "Event",
      "rawSource": "(Extracted from full RTF)",
      "cleanSource": "\u0026GAMUser.Load(\u0026UserId)\t\n\tFor each line\n\t\tIf \u0026Select\n\t\t\t\u0026isOK = \u0026GAMUser.AddRoleById(\u0026Id, \u0026Errors)\n\t\t\tIf not \u0026isOK\n\t\t\t\tFor \u0026Error in \u0026Errors\n\t\t\t\t\tMsg(Format(!\u0022%1 (GAM%2)\u0022, \u0026Error.Message, \u0026Error.Code))\n\t\t\t\tEndFor\t\n\t\t\t\tExit\n\t\t\tEndif\n\t\t\tif(\u0026isOK)\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\u0026ConfiguracionValor = ObtenerConfiguracion.Udp(!\u0027RolOperador\u0027)\n\t\t\t\tif(\u0026Name.Trim() = \u0026ConfiguracionValor.Trim())\n\t\t\t\t\tFor each DB.Operador\n\t\t\t\t\t\tWhere OperadorUserGUID = \u0026GAMUser.GUID\n\t\t\t\t\t\texit\n\t\t\t\t\twhen none\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\u0026Operador.Load(0)\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\u0026Operador.OperadorNombre = \u0026GAMUser.FirstName.Trim() \u002B\u0027 \u0027 \u002B \u0026GAMUser.LastName.Trim()\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\u0026Operador.OperadorUserGUID = \u0026GAMUser.GUID\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\u0026Operador.Save()\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\u0026GAMUserAttribute.Id = \u0022OperadorId\u0022\n\t\t\t  \t\t\t\u0026GAMUserAttribute.Value = \u0026Operador.OperadorId.ToFormattedString()\n\t\t\t  \t\t\t\u0026Att_isOK = \u0026GAMUser.SetAttribute(\u0026GAMUserAttribute,\u0026Errors)\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tendfor\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tendif\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tendif\n\t\t\n\t\tEndif\n\tEndFor\n\tIf \u0026isOK\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tCommit\n\t\treturn\n\tElse\n\t\tFor \u0026Error in \u0026Errors\n\t\t\tMsg(Format(!\u0022%1 (GAM%2)\u0022, \u0026Error.Message, \u0026Error.Code))\n\t\tEndFor\t\t\n\tEndif\n\t/* Generated by DVelop Work With Plus Pattern [Start] - Do not change */\n\t/* Generated by DVelop Work With Plus Pattern [End] - Do not change */"
